WEBVTT

00:26:03.449 --> 00:26:06.346
JaBarie Anderson: We're going to
make magic today. OK, so --

00:26:06.370 --> 00:26:08.049
(Woman speaks indistinctly)

00:26:08.073 --> 00:26:11.906
JA: This is "WorkLife's"
first live virtual haircut,

00:26:11.930 --> 00:26:15.436
and we're here with "You Probably
Need a Haircut" on webcam,

00:26:15.460 --> 00:26:16.937
because this is the new normal.

00:26:16.961 --> 00:26:19.844
(To Coco) You're going to need
a mirror, a comb and scissors.

00:26:19.868 --> 00:26:22.133
Coco: I have scissors,
they're the dog scissors.

00:26:22.157 --> 00:26:23.816
AG: Since I don't have hair,

00:26:23.840 --> 00:26:26.126
our producer Coco volunteered
to be a guinea pig.

00:26:26.150 --> 00:26:28.424
JA: So cut straight across,
a little bit higher.

00:26:28.448 --> 00:26:29.924
Coco: A little bit higher? OK.

00:26:29.948 --> 00:26:33.061
AG: Before the pandemic,
JaBarie Anderson was a freelance stylist.